librashader C ABI and Vulkan runtime

The build fetches librashader commit 87e8a97b50516d997defeaa168173dcd185d4022 from:
https://github.com/SnowflakePowered/librashader/tree/87e8a97b50516d997defeaa168173dcd185d4022

The librashader C header is SPDX MIT, Copyright 2022 chyyran. Its notice and warranty
disclaimer are retained in the fetched `include/librashader.h`.

The librashader and librashader-capi crates declare `MPL-2.0 OR GPL-3.0-only`. ECV
distributes the library under the MPL-2.0 option; the complete MPL-2.0 text is in
LICENSE-MPL-2.0 in this directory. The pinned, unmodified source is available at the
GitHub URL above. Release packaging must include this notice and license text, and must
provide recipients a reasonable way to obtain the corresponding pinned source.

The librashader dependency's own transitive Rust crates retain their respective upstream
license notices in Cargo metadata/source. The release license bundle must include those
third-party notices for the resolved lockfile.
